  "details": "<p>The Barrington Atlas Directory notes: Yanbu' to W Baysh SAU</p>",
  "review_state": "published",
  "type": "FeatureCollection",
  "description": "The Kinaidokolpitai were an ancient people inhabiting the western coastal strip of the Arabian Peninsula. The Barrington Atlas Directory notes that their territory was located from Yanbu' to the west of Baysh in Saudi Arabia.",
